{"work_id":"manohara","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/manohara/scenes/scene-042.md","record_count":35,"records":[{"id":"manohara-s042-d001","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"உக்ரசேனன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வீரசிம்ஹா! திடீரென புறப்படவேண்டியிருக்கும்... நமது படைவீரரெல்லாம் தயார்தானே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d002","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"வீர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தயார் அரசே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d003","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"உக்ர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"(ஓலையொன்றைக் கொடுத்து) புருஷோத்தமனுடைய அரண்மனையில் நுழைந்து, வசந்தசேனையின் மூலம் இதை அக்ஷயனிடம் சேர்ப்பிக்கவேண்டும்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d004","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"வ. சே.","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உக்ரசேனர் வந்துவிட்டாராம் சாது வேடத்தில் வருகிறார்களாம், எல்லோரும்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d005","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"போ. அக்ஷ.","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சாதுக்கள்... வேடம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d006","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"வ. சே.","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன அக்ஷயா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d007","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"போ. அக்ஷ.","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஒன்றுமில்ல. சாது வேடத்தில்தானம்மா பல சாம்ராஜ்யங்கள் கவிழ்ந்திருக்கின்றன...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d008","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"வ. சே.","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓகோ! ஆமாம்... அவர்களை எப்படி அரண்மனைக்குள் அழைப்பது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d009","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"அக்ஷ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆலோசிக்கவேண்டியதுதான்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d010","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"வ. சே","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆலோசனையென்ன, அரை நொடியில் ஏற்பாடு செய்கிறேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d011","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"அரசன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வரவேண்டும்...... வரவேண்டும்...... பாக்யவானானேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d012","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"உக்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பகவானின் பேரருள் சித்திக்கட்டும்... புருஷோத்தம ராஜன்... நாடகமே உலகம், நாளை நடப்பதை யாரறிவார்!......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":68,"printed_page":67}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d013","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"அர","speaker_de