it_id":"T042","speaker_label":"உக்ர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வாழ்க! வாழ்க...... ஏ ராஜன்... நல்ல சமயத்தில் தான் நான் வந்திருக்கிறேன். உனக்கு ஒரு பெரிய ஆபத்து காத்திருக்கிறது........","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":68,"printed_page":67}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d021","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"அர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஸ்வாமி!......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":68,"printed_page":67}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d022","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"உக்ர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அந்த ஆபத்திலிருந்து தப்பவேண்டுமானால் நீயும் உன் ராணியும் இந்த கணம் முதல் நாளை காலை வரையில் பிரிந்திருக்கவேண்டும்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":68,"printed_page":67}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d023","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"அர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்படியா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":68,"printed_page":67}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d024","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"உக்ர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இல்லாவிட்டால் மரணம் சம்பவிக்கும்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":68,"printed_page":67}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d025","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மகாராஜாவை பிரிந்திருப்பதா?......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":68,"printed_page":67}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},{"id":"manohara-s042-d026","scene_id":"manohara-s042","scene_ordinal":42,"transition_audit_id":"T042","speaker_label":"அர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நாளை காலை வரையில்தானே வசந்தி!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":68,"printed_page":67}],"source_scene_file":"scene-042.md"},